{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "64a61d451852cde1c896a216535670940091048f298a53107117172774bb7a15", "ja": "（翼の初公演が、無事に終わった。公演前は\nレッスンをサボったり、色々手がかかったけど……）", "zh": "（翼的首次公演顺利结束了。公演前她还翘过课，真是让我操了不少心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1aadd3b1af32d6e6e909dc04fa6e5ef0762ce973887d4731357e85983f38cdb6", "ja": "（今日は新人アイドルとして、初めての挨拶回りだ。\nいつも以上に、しっかりいかないとな！）", "zh": "（今天要第一次以新人成员偶像的身份去拜访打招呼。\n可得比平时更加认真才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f61f7cf96c37b271eac6f445977568cb5631209b409e6be4e6e4bd4bd95a13fb", "ja": "わぁ～、本物のTV局だ～！\nあっ、これから撮影が始まるところみたいですね！", "zh": "哇～，是真正的电视台耶～！\n啊，那边好像马上要开始拍摄了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "08b685e7d469b20d7982da4846530449dadc460ed1bcdfb1ef5cd541fd9e2083", "ja": "ねぇねぇ、{$P$}さん。\nせっかくだし、見学してきちゃダメ～？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}先生。\n难得来一趟，我们去参观一下，不行嘛～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9a43a44933466a3e937f39b775a07875db30becc818efb4920a27a481e19d3ee", "ja": "翼、今日はこのドラマのプロデューサーさんに\n挨拶しに来たんだぞ。", "zh": "翼，今天是来向这部电视剧的制作人打招呼的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1747847f0a3f0938c440814d97c026e4ef7163b3de676a0b7f52cc601ed75e43", "ja": "それに、見学するなら先に許可を取らないと……ん？\nあのカメラマンさん、前にお世話になった人だな。", "zh": "而且，要参观的话得先取得许可才行……嗯？\n那位摄影师，是以前受过他照顾的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "792534fd56a432735de52a8bb57cfa1e190506cc1a0e9f09a158e69d7cdf676f", "ja": "{$P$}さんの知ってる人？\nなら大丈夫ですよ、見学させてもらいましょ～！", "zh": "是{$P$}先生认识的人吗？\n那就没问题啦，我们去参观一下吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1b96d52d85b6c86356a20d5018c385deec14706f5cd4315c45e619235ed1ff75", "ja": "ついでにわたし、挨拶してきちゃいますね！\nすみませ～ん！", "zh": "顺便我也去打个招呼！\n不好意思～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7aaaa36ce2a682cba5b1ff5c213507686e738128c28474d52123f244ccf8216c", "ja": "えっ！？　待ってくれ翼、勝手に……！", "zh": "诶！？等一下，翼，别擅自……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d363f2e427fc869ade0405512ba2b9468c690c922bafe09ddeeebda0aead923a", "ja": "お疲れさまで～す！", "zh": "辛苦啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1010_camman", "source_sha256": "990f0d70657065a65a3e4861da331a785d40648b97f9a2859b3929ec89d05c9b", "ja": "お疲れ様です……ん？\nえっと、君は？", "zh": "辛苦了……嗯？\n那个，你是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f35da07988d81f416e76440f350af902cbe50cb0ccb554ec6f1156b0d3137c42", "ja": "と、突然すみません、765プロです。今、うちの\n新人アイドルと挨拶回りをさせていただいていて……。", "zh": "抱、抱歉突然打扰了，我是765制作人。现在正和我们事务所的\n新人偶像一起拜访问候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1012_camman", "source_sha256": "27a30dfde361107a19e71edf84fd24f997a1764722af56a736cd5427fc7762de", "ja": "ああ、765プロの！　お世話になってます。", "zh": "啊，765制作人！一直以来承蒙关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "84b40218d909953e61f9840ea68a520043578a4e964677e8ecbb7570d6e02fc5", "ja": "はじめまして！　わたし、新人アイドルの\n伊吹翼っていいます。よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "初次见面！我是新人偶像伊吹翼。请多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c42740bfdb94e4c68c34de820ea5fa780afeb92b4510dff1c649a356a0773a15", "ja": "あの、今日の撮影って見学できるんですか？\nわたし、見学してみたいです！", "zh": "那个，今天的拍摄可以旁观吗？\n我想去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1015_camman", "source_sha256": "c8fbf0519964e42f6f7d024c40afd0934d6b07c3f70afac952fbc13f39784aa3", "ja": "見学させてあげたいけど、今日は\n本番が始まるのは午後からなんだよね。", "zh": "虽然想让你参观一下，但今天\n正式演出要到下午才开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4b4f591b5e4ca76d0c798d5c38ffd9a05290747044a26bde047ddcf515ec7fd9", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？　じゃあそれまで、\nスタッフさんは何をしてるんですか？", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？那在这之前，工作人员都在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bdade552a95e45b74d7562ec67d96991f4661b5da389e67c19a2f714918bb3e2", "ja": "スタッフさん達は、準備で忙しいんだよ。本番前に\nカメラアングルをテストして、調整したり……。", "zh": "工作人员们都在忙着准备呢。正式开始前要测试镜头角度，再进行调整……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e5e7ea20dd705986096cc3fc3c03c2d90b9ea49409ce23cece1628516adcf77b", "ja": "わぁ～！　そのカメラ、すっごく大きいんですね～。\n撮影するの、大変そう……。", "zh": "哇～！那台摄像机，真的好大呀～。\n用它拍摄，感觉会很辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d8f8eb40af9a3c2a2f0e40af78b874b1ef72f90dcffb25cf7fbb0aa72aa77943", "ja": "わたしもいつか、こんなカメラで\nステキに撮ってもらえるようになるのかな～？", "zh": "我以后也能让大家用这种相机，\n把我拍得漂漂亮亮的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1020_camman", "source_sha256": "95aeadcf7625acb197aa69a27e411522b2255c8b2f6c29c7f748ddf67c2db753", "ja": "はは、君面白いね。えっと、伊吹翼ちゃんだったかな。\nカメラテスト、手伝ってみる？", "zh": "哈哈，你这人真有意思。呃……你是叫伊吹翼，对吧？要不要来帮忙测试一下摄像机？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1eafd29be076448fe07821bd26d6c51a1abc2953a81b2c7865b2872d3da70a52", "ja": "え～っ、いいんですか！？　わたし、やってみたい！\nいいですよね、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "诶～，可以吗！？我想试试看！\n可以的吧，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d24d567cc44ca58d1a4c21234a7cbcd53a1758dd52fa0c8cc3d942ef72f35bc2", "ja": "構わないけど……翼、これは遊びじゃないからな？\nしっかり言われた事だけするように。いいな？", "zh": "倒是没关系……不过，翼，这可不是玩闹哦？\n一定要好好照吩咐的去做，明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "41987745337f3fa29337379ad07a948adfadebfef8456c27a7985d4e0449bf21", "ja": "は～い！　その代わり、上手にできたら、\n本番の撮影も見学させてくださいね♪", "zh": "好～的！不过作为交换，要是我能做得很好的话，也请让我参观正式拍摄哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1025_p", "source_sha256": "cc8bc9d1fafda4816a2e9445e26d9f3a0be0cdc9e1a4ccacb57c133a746e07f3", "ja": "（急遽、飛び入りで撮影準備を手伝う事になった翼は、\nカメラマンさんの要求に、そつなく応えていた……）", "zh": "（临时加入进来帮忙准备拍摄的翼，干净利落地满足了摄影师的要求……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1026_camman", "source_sha256": "cde307a7a80c3ca5eac74f9c235feca6b602de6d3a4cb359c01f024d0c881b46", "ja": "ありがとう、お疲れさま！　いや～、彼女、\nカンがいいんだね。お陰でビシッと画が決まったよ。", "zh": "谢谢，辛苦了！哎呀～她的直觉真敏锐。多亏了她，画面一下子就定下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1027_camman", "source_sha256": "2c6e3f2558139ad6e54dd0ce75e4a5765941772493a621f3e48c8068643d4c7e", "ja": "何か新人向けの仕事があったら、推薦しておきますよ。\nそれじゃ、また！", "zh": "如果有适合新人的工作，我会推荐给你的。\n那么，下次见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1028_p", "source_sha256": "d90f5655f4702c07d3afcae30656b3394b93534e5c3b626be0268843a657e893", "ja": "はい！\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好的！\n我才要请您多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "146faea599f6b8546cf683a2e286012c538aaba9b274ac01885ec594f1b4ec32", "ja": "あ～楽しかった！　ドラマの撮影って、\nあんなふうにやるんですね～。", "zh": "啊～真开心！原来电视剧就是那样拍摄的呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f2b54995ee6e7d4539a02a053fc0fcb2094063ad377366ad7b7468ab744cd1aa", "ja": "ドラマのプロデューサーさんにも挨拶できたし、\nスタッフさんたち、みんな優しかったし♪", "zh": "还和电视剧的制作人打了招呼，工作人员们也都很温柔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c8799bab8c942b52dd4f22e277800a14f91b898feacc50de398847a00b0c70c8", "ja": "TV局って、すっごくいいところですね、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "电视台真是个很棒的地方呢，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1032_p", "source_sha256": "6fdaba244400cecb2f35d542eb26f2dc895087baa97a10125e208e7cec0ec5c6", "ja": "いや……TV局の人達が優しいというよりは、\n翼が物怖じせずに誰とでも話したからじゃないかな。", "zh": "不……与其说是电视台的人温柔，\n倒不如说是因为翼毫不怯场，能和任何人聊得来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b7badee85edf7d2ff09e58b7d72bf50e37ffc934a783010f661595cb26cbfcb3", "ja": "そうなんですか？\nわたし、普通にしてただけなんだけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n我只是和平时一样而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1034_p", "source_sha256": "2d07762569e25fd630f317fe53df1a567149f271245906a974079ff2c7f7a5d6", "ja": "翼は、普段から人に可愛がられてそうだよな……。\n家族はご両親以外に、兄弟がいるんだっけ？", "zh": "翼平时也总是很受人疼爱吧……除了父母以外，你还有兄弟姐妹来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d9ca8e49f9b3ba7e17987ffa859b83db448034636515015f2f70396623c4e242", "ja": "そうで～す！　おにいちゃんとおねえちゃんがいるん\nですけど、二人共わたしにすっごく優しいんですよ～。", "zh": "就是这样～！我有哥哥和姐姐，他们俩对我特别好～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "aea066273f9509a48ec0135addc6ebf5ac0af9a09eb391a1a5b832ffcca9c3b6", "ja": "お母さんがケーキを買ってきてくれた時も、\n「翼が最初に選んでいいよ」って言ってくれるし！", "zh": "妈妈买蛋糕回来时，他们还会对我说：“翼可以第一个挑哦！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1037_p", "source_sha256": "588c2bfe38a95478d1fca21840f523169c04fd8fe6099a82773ca1553af07f7e", "ja": "そうか……本当に、皆から可愛がられているんだな。\nその割に敬語はちゃんと使えてるのが意外だけど……。", "zh": "这样啊……看来你真的很受大家疼爱呢。\n不过，没想到你对老师和年长的人居然能好好使用敬语……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1e716d4752624d2421dab3285cdb7f73cc342da3d230b4f604a415f6b1e21c5d", "ja": "先生とか年上の人には、ちゃんと敬語を使わなくちゃ。\nだってそのほうが、かわいがってもらえるし♪", "zh": "对老师和年长的人，必须好好使用敬语才行。\n因为这样才会更受他们疼爱嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1039_016tsu", "source_sha256": "40f58ff32533f6bc8f8b0193e48309c2785a1c78b0481b3328974b40660e7ad7", "ja": "でも「敬語使えてえらいね」ってほめてくれたのは、\n{$P$}さんが初めてかも……えへへ。", "zh": "不过，第一个夸我“敬语用得真好”的人，可能就是{$P$}先生……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "150a49bfac2afb817cb3aac403373a29eab7cc14c04e0499af02ae2feacd7964", "ja": "{$P$}さん、これからも\nわたしのこと、たくさんほめてくださいね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今后也要\n多多夸奖我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_016tsu_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_016tsu_004_1041_p", "source_sha256": "d507c4cdf33606805774287d96a3711e65102bd92f353cddd54f08196721d137", "ja": "（誰にでも可愛がられる事も、翼の長所だ。\nその強みを活かして、仕事に繋げていけるといいな）", "zh": "（谁都喜欢她，也是翼的优点。希望她能发挥这一优势，把它和工作联系起来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
